$CMP GW2AR-LV18EQ144PC8_17
D The GW2AR FPGAs are members of the 2 series of the Arora family. The GW2AR devices are system-in-package chips with memory chips integrated into them based on the GW2A devices, featuring high- performance DSP resources, high-speed LVDS interfaces, and abundant BSRAM memory resources. These embedded resources combined with a streamlined FPGA architecture and 55nm process make the GW2AR series of FPGA products suitable for high-speed and low-cost applications.
